---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Holy Grail Archive"
  description="Holy Grail Archive aggregates discontinued cosmetics data from public marketplaces, brand archives, and Reddit communities. Data-only. No reviews, no medical claims."
>
  <div class="container narrow">
    <h1>About Holy Grail Archive</h1>
    <p>Holy Grail Archive is a data-only aggregator for discontinued cosmetics. We answer one question: <em>did this product really get discontinued, and what is it worth now?</em></p>
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Collect launch year, discontinued year, and original price from public brand archives.</li>
      <li>Track resale price history from public sold listings on eBay and other marketplaces.</li>
      <li>Surface successor and dupe products mentioned in Reddit communities like r/MakeupAddiction.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we do NOT do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not write personal reviews. Operator has no cosmetology credentials and no professional makeup background.</li>
      <li>We do not authenticate products. Buyers must verify authenticity at the point of purchase.</li>
      <li>We do not give medical, dermatological, or allergy advice.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Data sourcing</h2>
    <p>Every published product page lists its sources. Pages without verified sources are kept as drafts and not published.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 720px; }
  h1 { margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
